---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import profileImg from "~/assets/imgs/profile.webp"

const email = "support@sajam.dev"
const upworkUrl = "https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/shrjamal"
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-14 border-t border-line px-6 py-20 md:grid-cols-2 md:px-14"
>
  <div>
    <div class="mb-3 font-mono text-[13px] text-accent">// about</div>
    <h2 class="mb-6 text-[28px] font-bold md:text-[34px]">Who you work with</h2>

    <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4">
      <Image
        src={profileImg}
        alt="Jamal Shr"
        width={128}
        height={128}
        class="size-16 flex-none rounded-full border border-card-line object-cover"
      />
      <div>
        <div class="text-lg font-semibold">Jamal Shr</div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[13px] text-muted">Founder · Software developer · Morocco</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-[15.5px] leading-[1.7] text-muted">
      <p>
        SAJAM is run by Jamal Shr, a software developer from Morocco. Most of the projects on this
        page were built for clients through Upwork, from the first plan to launch, and the rest are
        products we run ourselves.
      </p>
      <p>
        Running our own products means the work does not stop at a clean demo. We deal with billing,
        uptime, support, bug reports, and the small decisions that keep software useful. That shapes
        how we build for clients: fewer surprises, sensible tradeoffs, and code the next person can
        understand.
      </p>
      <p>
        Several of these projects are being prepared as open source. Their repositories will be
        linked from each case study as they are released.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a
      href={upworkUrl}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="mt-6 inline-block font-mono text-[14px] text-accent no-underline hover:underline"
    >
      Client reviews on Upwork ↗
    </a>
  </div>

  <div
    id="contact"
    class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-3.5 self-center rounded-xl border border-card-line p-[34px]"
    style="background:radial-gradient(400px 200px at 80% 0%,light-dark(rgba(37,99,235,.1),rgba(37,99,235,.25)),transparent 70%),light-dark(#ffffff,#0a1120)"
  >
    <h2 class="text-[27px] font-bold">Have something in mind?</h2>
    <p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted">
      Send us a plain email. Tell us what you are trying to build, fix, or simplify. We will reply
      within one business day.
    </p>
    <a
      href={`mailto:${email}`}
      class="btn-cta self-start rounded-[9px] px-7 py-3.5 font-mono text-[15.5px] font-semibold no-underline"
    >
      {email}
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
